{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-feedback-loops","title":"生产 Agent 系统的质量反馈回路","stage":"DONE","category":"bridges","categoryLabel":"Bridges · 跨 Tier 协同","chapterCount":2,"docCount":6,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"个人 agent 体系同样需要质量工程：给常用的 prompt 与 skill 建小型 golden 集、版本化管理、改前必回归；再用使用遥测、漂移检测与改进提案，把运行中的体系接进持续改善的闭环。规模虽小，纪律不减。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eval-foundations","title":"Eval Foundations","docCount":3,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"personal-golden-sets","title":"个人 Golden 集的构建","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations/personal-golden-sets","wordCount":1953,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"prompt-skill-versioning","title":"Prompt 与 Skill 的版本化","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations/prompt-skill-versioning","wordCount":2031,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"regression-before-change","title":"改前回归的纪律","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations/regression-before-change","wordCount":2071,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"个人尺度的评测不需要平台与团队，只需要一套小而有效的纪律：给每个常用的 prompt 与 skill 维护一组带预期的 golden 样例，把它们当代码一样版本化，并在任何行为变更前先跑回归。本章从 golden 集的构建讲起，再讲 prompt 与 skill 的版本管理，最后落到「改前回归」这条最小但最关键的工程纪律。这三件事合在一起，就是一个人也能负担得起的质量反馈闭环。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"production-loops","title":"Production Loops","docCount":3,"url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usage-telemetry","title":"使用遥测的采集","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops/usage-telemetry","wordCount":2419,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"drift-and-rot-detection","title":"漂移与腐化检测","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops/drift-and-rot-detection","wordCount":2525,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-to-improvement","title":"从反馈到改进提案","url":"/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops/feedback-to-improvement","wordCount":2327,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"一个 agent 体系装好之后真正的考验才开始：它每天都在被使用，也每天都在悄悄偏离你当初的设计。本章讲运行期的三件事——采集最小可用的使用遥测、定期检测配置与文档的漂移腐化、再把这些信号加工成具体的改进提案。三步连起来，你的个人 harness 就不再靠记忆和直觉维护，而是有了一条持续自我改善的闭环。\n"}]}